        "description": "每次攻击有<@ba.vup>{attack@tomimi_s_2.prob:0%}</>的概率随机触发下列效果之一：目标<$ba.stun>晕眩</><@ba.vup>{attack@tomimi_s_2.stun}</>秒；当次攻击力提升至<@ba.vup>{attack@tomimi_s_2.atk_scale:0%}</>；当次攻击造成群体伤害",
        "skillType": "MANUAL",
        "durationType": "NONE",
